OL,3,GNEWSAPokemon star catches 'em all at
OL,4,AWorld Championships
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a San Francisco arena packed with
OL,7,F18,000 people, 16-year-old Vikram put
OL,8,Fhis headphones on and prepared for the
OL,9,Fultimate Pokemon battle. After seven
OL,10,Fyears learning the ins and outs of the
OL,11,Fgame, the North Yorkshire teenager
OL,12,Fwalked away as the Pokemon World
OL,13,FChampion.
OL,15,F"It was quite intimidating but after I
OL,16,Fsat down, I realised this is just
OL,17,Fanother tournament," says Vikram, from
OL,18,FMalton.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
