OL,3,GNEWSAPokemon star catches 'em all at
OL,4,AWorld Championships
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It felt unreal to be playing Pokemon
OL,7,Fin such a big arena on such a big
OL,8,Fstage, especially with 200,000 people
OL,9,Fwatching on the live streams."
OL,11,FThe massive event invites trainers from
OL,12,Fall over the world to battle for glory
OL,13,Fin the video game, trading card,
OL,14,FPokemon Go and Pokemon Unite divisions
OL,15,Fof the game, which are split into three
OL,16,Fage groups - juniors, seniors and
OL,17,Fmasters.
